sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as UI / MCP / CLI
    box rgb(235,245,255) Local API boundary
        participant Auth as Session and scope
        participant API as Local API host
    end
    box rgb(240,255,240) locald application boundary
        participant App as Command handler
        participant Domain as Domain model
        participant DB as Isar
        participant Events as Event publisher
    end

    Caller->>Auth: Command request_id and command_id
    Auth->>API: Authenticated request
    API->>App: Validated command DTO
    App->>DB: Lookup command outcome
    alt Previously committed command
        DB-->>App: Stored outcome
    else New command
        App->>Domain: Evaluate transition
        Domain-->>App: New state and logical operation
        App->>DB: Atomic state plus outcome plus operation plus sequence
        DB-->>App: Commit
        App-->>Events: Publish committed event asynchronously
    end
    App-->>API: Durable outcome
    API-->>Caller: Result revision or stable error
    Note over Caller,Events: Owner locald, auth Local API session and scope, storage Isar, external cloud systems none, async committed event
